## SQ-RPS-08 | Alex's Mobs stub missing a field: mixin skipped, one warning, no crash
@group B
@commands Boot with `rps alex` after a stub swap (section `@@prep run`): the server's Alex's Mobs jar is replaced by a copy whose `EffectFleetFooted` lacks the int field `lastDuration` (`tools/scratch_query/rps_fixture.py stub`, renamed over the hard link) (second half of RPS-06; id 08 because the plan's single RPS-06 needs two boots)
@pass `Done (` reached; exactly one warning `[solraspberrypie] Alex's Mobs com.github.alexthe666.alexsmobs.effect.EffectFleetFooted lacks <member>: the Fleet-Footed fix is off (tested with Alex's Mobs 1.21.1)` (member `int field lastDuration` or `applyEffectTick(LivingEntity, int) (m_6742_)`); no `Fleet-Footed fix failed` line; no crash, no mixin error
@fails the member check and `require = 0` in `FleetFootedMixin` / its plugin (P6)
