bootexpect \[solraspberrypie\] Alex's Mobs com\.github\.alexthe666\.alexsmobs\.effect\.EffectFleetFooted lacks int field lastDuration: the Fleet-Footed fix is off \(tested with Alex's Mobs 1\.21\.1\)
bootreject Fleet-Footed fix failed|InvalidInjectionException|Mixin apply.*solraspberrypie.*failed|MixinApplyError|Encountered an unexpected exception
