## SQ-RPS-10 | isolated: a wrong-shape diversity table is skipped (PR-RP-04)
@group B
@commands rps only set; the server's Raspberry Pie copy gets `solraspberrypie/diversity/bad.json` = `{"values": [1, 2]}` (section `@@prep run` `rps_fixture.py table`); boot. The tables load right after `Done (` on a bare server (r1123rp SQ-RPS-01 log), so no player is needed
@pass one `Diversity table solraspberrypie:bad.json has the wrong shape (...); skipped` error line; then `No usable diversity table ...; Apple Pie's values apply` (the bad file was the only one: foods keep Apple Pie's values); no exception later; the server reaches `Done (`
@fails `Diversity.use` / `read`
# steps written r1123rp 2026-11-23 (runner-rp): fixture rps_fixture.py table, own section for the @@prep
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect Diversity table solraspberrypie:bad\.json has the wrong shape \(.*\); skipped
bootexpect No usable diversity table \(solraspberrypie/diversity/\*\.json\) in any mod; Apple Pie's values apply
bootexpect Diet ladder: 44 rungs, 4 slots, 8 pool effects
bootreject Exception in server tick loop|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell grep -c "has the wrong shape" logs/latest.log; test "$(grep -c "has the wrong shape" logs/latest.log)" = 1

