## SQ-RPS-07 | in the pack: table split, unknown id loads, count logged once
@group A
@commands Pack server (full pack, Creative Delight carries the pack table). The server's Raspberry Pie copy gets `solraspberrypie/diversity/rps07.json` = bread 7.25 plus the unknown `nosuchmod:thing` (section `@@prep run` `rps_fixture.py table`); boot; bot rps7 eats bread, apple, cooked beef, baked potato, carrot (5 foods open the pack gate `minFoodsToActivate` 5); `data get entity rps7 ForgeCaps` (RPS-07)
@pass the server boots; one INFO summary line `Diversity table: <n> values, <m> family members from <k> file(s) (creativedelight:creativedelight.json, <owner>:<file>.json); <s> ids skipped (mod not loaded)` (logger `solraspberrypie/diversity`; no per-id warning; a file overriding another adds one `Diversity table: <n> entries of <later> over <earlier>` line); other ids in the same file apply (`/cdevtest` reads or the tooltip value of a known id in the file matches it)
@fails `Diversity` loader merge and optional-id handling (P3); the table's new location in Creative Delight (P8)
# steps written r1123rp 2026-11-23 (runner-rp): the table rides in a copy of the Raspberry Pie jar (owner solraspberrypie,
# sorted after creativedelight, so it overrides bread). CD table values: bread 2.0859, apple 1.038, cooked_beef 2.2049,
# baked_potato 1.73, carrot 0.9391; Apple Pie decay (startDecay 0, endDecay 32) weighs the meal n back by 1 - n/32:
# maxDiversity 11.967 with the fixture's bread applied, 7.448 without (r1123rp).
bootexpect Diversity table: 1 entries of solraspberrypie:rps07\.json over creativedelight:creativedelight\.json
bootexpect Diversity table: [0-9]+ values, [0-9]+ family members from 2 file\(s\) \(creativedelight:creativedelight\.json, solraspberrypie:rps07\.json\); [1-9][0-9]* ids skipped \(mod not loaded\)
bootreject nosuchmod:thing
shell grep -c "Diversity table: [0-9]* values" logs/latest.log; test "$(grep -c "Diversity table: [0-9]* values" logs/latest.log)" = 1
> forceload add 0 990 40 1010
> pbot spawn rps7 10 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> pbot hunger rps7 2
> pbot inv rps7 set 0 minecraft:bread 1
> pbot inv rps7 select 0
